HOOK(0): associated bank (Bank)
HOOK(1): bank client list (Cli2)
HOOK(2): current machine supplier (Broch)
HOOK(3): to vintage in use (Vint)]]></text>
							</description>
							<object name="Broch" compute="false">
								<counts>1,1</counts>
								<description>
									<text><![CDATA[Known machine supplier firm object

SHOOK: supplier's customer list (Cli)]]></text>
								</description>
								<element name="__IDs" type="parameter">
									<values>0;0</values>
									<description>
										<text><![CDATA[ID number of supplier]]></text>
